    "All55 complete embedded source bodies in the previous report were independently rehashed and match current fresh source499fe row identities. Its package script/config route analysis remains source-applicable despite its historical whole97 evidence scope; none of its historical runtime outcomes transfers.",
    "Root .bin/tsc is present as a2383-byte regular shim. Its full body was not available as a standalone Git blob in this follow-up. A404 from the Git object read is not filesystem absence and does not establish which compiler the bare MCP tsc script would resolve."
